# Route: guide 44 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Dwarf (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 58 to 59, 18
# quests, 1.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Un'Goro Crater, Blasted Lands, Western Plaguelands): Lakkari Tar Pits
# -> Ironstone Plateau -> Fire Plume Ridge -> Lakkari Tar Pits -> The
# Slithering Scar -> Nethergarde Keep -> Serpent's Coil -> Nethergarde Keep ->
# Ruins of Andorhal -> Thondroril River -> Darrowmere Lake -> Ruins of
# Andorhal -> Sorrow Hill.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Nekrum's Medallion (2991), Barov Family Fortune (5343),
# Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the Herald (5384),
# The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors (5515), Of
# Love and Family (5848).

